      "value": "FYI, it's occurs in [this avatar](avtr_f3b0389d-3957-4750-aae1-528eab998499) too.\n\nThere's a feature of pinning the mouth to world in this avatar by using VRC parent constraint's \"Freeze to World\" feature and it's position has a difference in both first person and mirror/camera.\n\nYou can test the feature by enabling \"口空間固定\" in the expression menu.\n\n(Note that the red trail is for test and not included in the original)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
